{"1981700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Jacob's Quest Anniversary Edition", "steam_appid": 1981700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jacob's Quest Anniversary Edition has Full Controller Support.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jacob’s Quest: 10th Anniversary Edition HD</strong> is finally here — a completely reimagined, modern rebuild of the beloved JRPG. Owners of the original game receive this massive upgrade <strong>free</strong>, now enhanced with stunning effects, beautifully upscaled sprites, and a full suite of modern features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate a decade of adventure with a version rebuilt from the ground up for today’s PCs, widescreen displays, and controllers. Whether you’re returning to Jacob’s world or discovering it for the first time, this is the definitive way to experience the legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant elemental world, rescue the four sacred crystals, and stop a sinister plot threatening all life. Designed for newcomers and JRPG veterans alike, Jacob’s Quest delivers classic 90s charm with modern enhancements and fast, satisfying progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Reborn</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast elemental realm filled with dungeons, secrets, puzzles, and powerful bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand‑drawn sprites enhanced with modern post‑processing and visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully reworked presentation built for HD and ultrawide displays</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Soundtrack That Hits Hard</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An addictive, energetic score featuring electric‑guitar‑driven themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive ambience that brings Jacob’s world to life</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic JRPG Gameplay — Modernized</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn‑based battles inspired by the golden age of 90s RPGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge roster of spells, abilities, and tactical options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action‑layered exploration: jump, hookshot, block puzzles, and more</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compelling Characters &amp; Adventure</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorable heroes, allies, and villains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story crafted for fans of classic JRPGs — heartfelt, adventurous, and nostalgic.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steam Deck Compatibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tested by Valve and rated <strong>Playable</strong> on Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981700/extras/eb0bc048bcaee8e5d923296880d70ef1.poster.avif?t=1784288139\" width=730 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981700/extras/eb0bc048bcaee8e5d923296880d70ef1.webm?t=1784288139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981700/extras/eb0bc048bcaee8e5d923296880d70ef1.mp4?t=1784288139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jacob’s Quest: 10th Anniversary Edition HD</strong> is finally here — a completely reimagined, modern rebuild of the beloved JRPG. Owners of the original game receive this massive upgrade <strong>free</strong>, now enhanced with stunning effects, beautifully upscaled sprites, and a full suite of modern features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate a decade of adventure with a version rebuilt from the ground up for today’s PCs, widescreen displays, and controllers. Whether you’re returning to Jacob’s world or discovering it for the first time, this is the definitive way to experience the legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant elemental world, rescue the four sacred crystals, and stop a sinister plot threatening all life. Designed for newcomers and JRPG veterans alike, Jacob’s Quest delivers classic 90s charm with modern enhancements and fast, satisfying progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Reborn</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast elemental realm filled with dungeons, secrets, puzzles, and powerful bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand‑drawn sprites enhanced with modern post‑processing and visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully reworked presentation built for HD and ultrawide displays</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Soundtrack That Hits Hard</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An addictive, energetic score featuring electric‑guitar‑driven themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive ambience that brings Jacob’s world to life</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic JRPG Gameplay — Modernized</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn‑based battles inspired by the golden age of 90s RPGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge roster of spells, abilities, and tactical options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action‑layered exploration: jump, hookshot, block puzzles, and more</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compelling Characters &amp; Adventure</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorable heroes, allies, and villains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story crafted for fans of classic JRPGs — heartfelt, adventurous, and nostalgic.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steam Deck Compatibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tested by Valve and rated <strong>Playable</strong> on Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981700/extras/eb0bc048bcaee8e5d923296880d70ef1.poster.avif?t=1784288139\" width=730 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981700/extras/eb0bc048bcaee8e5d923296880d70ef1.webm?t=1784288139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981700/extras/eb0bc048bcaee8e5d923296880d70ef1.mp4?t=1784288139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Become a Legend in Jacob's Quest Anniversary Edition, a JRPG that anyone can pick up and play. Save the four crystals of the world and prevent a vile plot from unfolding. With epic battles and world progression, Jacob's Quest is the RPG of choice. Now remade from the ground up for modern gaming!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981700/966405f0a4e2f1515674eddea47f82590c929228/header.jpg?t=1784288139", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981700/219de8a4980b1b3708eefc33d3008b218a72d353/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784288139", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981700/219de8a4980b1b3708eefc33d3008b218a72d353/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784288139", "website": "https://spacefarergames.com/title/jacobsquest/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum":